B.a3t=new A.aK("Burada bug\xfcn harcayabilece\u011fin para var: hesaplar\u0131ndaki para ve kartlar\u0131ndaki bo\u015f limit. Rakamlara dokununca ilgili sayfa a\xe7\u0131l\u0131r; 1\u20137 tu\u015flar\u0131yla sayfalar aras\u0131nda ge\xe7ebilirsin.","This is what you can spend today: the money in your accounts plus available card limit. Tap a figure to open its page; keys 1\u20137 switch between pages.")
B.a3B=new A.aK('Harcama eklemek i\xe7in + Harcama\'ya ya da N tu\u015funa bas. H\u0131zl\u0131 giri\u015fle (H) tek seferde bir\xe7ok sat\u0131r yazabilirsin: "kahve 85", "market 420".','Press + Spend or the N key to log spending. Quick entry (H) takes many lines at once: "coffee 85", "groceries 420".')
B.a3p=new A.aK("Kartlar\u0131n ve kredilerin burada. Kart\u0131n yan\u0131ndaki \xd6de ile kart borcunu \xf6de; ekstre gelince k\xe2\u011f\u0131t simgesinden ekle. Findeks notunu da buradan takip edersin.","Your cards and loans live here. Use Pay next to a card to pay it off; add the statement with the paper icon when it arrives. Your credit score is tracked here too.")
B.a2o=new A.aK("Bir bankaya dokununca o bankadaki hesaplar\u0131n, kartlar\u0131n ve bor\xe7lar\u0131n tek sayfada a\xe7\u0131l\u0131r.","Tap a bank to see its accounts, cards and debts on one page.")
B.a2X=new A.aK("Ay\u0131n \xf6demeleri takvimde. Bir \xf6demeyi yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131nda sat\u0131rdaki yuvarla\u011fa dokun; \xf6dendi olarak i\u015faretlenir. Ay bitince Ay\u0131 kapat ile kapat\u0131rs\u0131n.","This month's payments are on the calendar. When you pay something, tap the circle on its row to mark it paid. Close the month when it ends.")
B.a3k=new A.aK("Almak istedi\u011fin \xfcr\xfcn\xfcn linkini ve fiyat\u0131n\u0131 yaz; nakit, kart, taksit ve biriktirme se\xe7eneklerini hesaplar. Be\u011fendiklerini istek listesine ekle.","Type a product's link and price; it works out cash, card, instalment and saving options. Put the ones you like on your wish list.")
B.a3j=new A.aK("Profiller, yedekler ve dil burada. Kurulum sihirbaz\u0131n\u0131 ve bu ipu\xe7lar\u0131n\u0131 da buradan yeniden a\xe7abilirsin.","Profiles, backups and language are here. You can reopen the setup wizard and these tips from here too.")
